sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Admin (Governance Role - A-01 & A-02)
    participant Ctrl as AdminAnalyticsController
    participant Svc as AdminAnalyticsService
    participant Audit as AuditLogService
    participant Helper as TabularReportExportHelper & PiiMaskingHelper
    participant Interceptor as AuditLogImmutabilityInterceptor
    participant AI as FastAPI AI Service
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext (PostgreSQL)

    Note over Admin, DB: 1. Xem KPI điều hành & Biểu đồ phân tích từ dữ liệu xác thực (UC A-01 - BR-ADM-07)
    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/analytics/kpi-summary?period=30d [JWT Admin]
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetExecutiveKpiSummaryAsync(query, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Query Users (Active), RecyclerProfiles (Verified), HandoverReceipts (Status == Completed)
    DB-->>Svc: ActiveCitizens, VerifiedRecyclers, RecycledWeightKg, GrossTradeValueVnd
    Svc->>DB: Query ServiceOrders (OrderStatus == Paid) & Operational Backlog
    DB-->>Svc: VietQrServiceRevenueVnd + Pending Queues
    Svc->>AI: GET /api/stats (Timeout 2s)
    alt AI Vision Service Online
        AI-->>Svc: { total_scans, ood_count, accuracy }
    else AI Vision Service Offline
        Svc-->>Svc: Fallback calculate from AIFeedbackLogs
    end
    Svc-->>Ctrl: ExecutiveKpiSummaryDto
    Ctrl-->>Admin: 200 OK ApiResponse<ExecutiveKpiSummaryDto> (MSG-GEN-01)

    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/analytics/charts?months=6
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetAnalyticsChartsAsync(6, ct)
    Svc->>DB: Aggregate Completed HandoverReceipts, HandoverRequestItems & AIFeedbackLogs
    DB-->>Svc: MonthlyTrend, WasteCategoryBreakdown, AiQualityByGroup
    Svc-->>Ctrl: AnalyticsChartsDto
    Ctrl-->>Admin: 200 OK ApiResponse<AnalyticsChartsDto> (MSG-GEN-01)

    Note over Admin, DB: 2. Trích xuất báo cáo CSV/XLSX che PII & tự động ghi Audit Log (UC A-02 - BR-ADM-05, BR-ADM-06)
    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/reports/export?dataset=accounts&format=xlsx
    Ctrl->>Svc: ExportSystemReportAsync(adminUserId, query, ct)
    alt Định dạng không thuộc {csv, xlsx} hoặc dataset không hợp lệ
        Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw BusinessRuleException("BR-ADM-06")
        Ctrl-->>Admin: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
    else Hợp lệ
        Svc->>DB: Load dataset records in requested UTC date window
        DB-->>Svc: Raw User / Handover / VietQR / Audit records
        Svc->>Helper: MaskEmail() & MaskPhone() (BR-ADM-06) -> BuildUtf8BomCsv / BuildMinimalOpenXmlWorkbook
        Helper-->>Svc: Anonymized CSV / XLSX byte[] + rowCount
        Svc->>Audit: LogAsync("EXPORT_REPORT", "SystemReport", dataset, newValues={dataset, format, piiMasked=true})
        Audit->>DB: Add AuditLog & SaveChangesAsync()
        DB->>Interceptor: SavingChangesAsync() -> Verify Append-Only (No Update/Delete)
        Interceptor-->>DB: Allow INSERT
        Audit-->>Svc: Audit entry committed
        Svc-->>Ctrl: ExportedReportFileResult
        Ctrl-->>Admin: 200 OK FileContentResult + Header X-EcoLink-Message-Code: MSG-ADM-02
    end

    Note over Admin, DB: 3. Tra cứu Nhật ký kiểm toán bất biến chỉ đọc (UC A-02 - BR-ADM-05)
    Admin->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/admin/audit-logs?action=EXPORT_REPORT&pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
    Ctrl->>Audit: GetAuditLogsAsync(filter, ct)
    Audit->>DB: Query AuditLogs AsNoTracking().OrderByDescending(CreatedAt)
    DB-->>Audit: PagedResult<AuditLogItemDto>
    Audit-->>Ctrl: PagedResult<AuditLogItemDto>
    Ctrl-->>Admin: 200 OK ApiResponse<PagedResult<AuditLogItemDto>> (MSG-GEN-01)
